        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Cold Rot"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(cold, curse, disease, divine, necromancy)\n\nThis affliction can't be reduced below stage 1, nor can damage from it be healed, until successfully treated with remove curse or a similar effect. The affliction can then be removed as normal for a disease. A creature killed by cold rot turns to ice crystals and can't be resurrected except by a 7th-level resurrect ritual or similar magic\n\nDC: 24\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\n- Stage 1: slowed 1 for 1 round, then carrier with no ill effect (1 minute)\n- Stage 2: 5d6 negative damage plus 2d6 cold damage and stupefied 2 (1 day)"
            },
            "id": "aff4e1b3-1e92-4e3a-b71b-49a825a0b93a",
